            "review_title": "Review at Moc Rieu Nuong",
            "review_text": "GhettoSerious\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam18 contributions\n0\nStomach ache, feel ill after meal price 400k/person\nJan 2021\nPros: \n- Grilled food is tasted good\nCons:\n- All grilled food have the same taste even in different dishes. This one happened in hotpots too.\n- I ate some kind of meats in Grilled set, fried rice with scallops, sticky rice in Chicken set, vegetable in Crab hot pot. Drank 2 bottles of Hoegaarden rose beer. \nIn the next morning, my stomach feel bad, nearly diarrhea. My body sometimes felt cold sometimes felt hot.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 26, 2021",
